{"schemaVersion":2,"id":"meetdeet-2010-meet-science2-08","exam":"MEET_DEET","year":2010,"subject":"chemistry","number":8,"points":2,"unitId":"thermo","unitLabel":"열역학·열화학","topic":"자유에너지","classificationStatus":"keyword-candidate-unverified","classificationCandidates":["thermo","solution","equilibrium"],"stem":"그림은 2X(g)⇄Y(g)반응에서 전체 압력을 시간에 따라 나타낸\n것이다. 초기에 기체 X는 330K에서 6.0기압으로 존재한다. \nB시점에서 온도를 300K로 낮추었다.\n위의 반응에 대한 설명으로 옳은 것만을 <보기>에서 있는 대로 고른 \n것은? \n<보 기>\nㄱ. AB 구간에서 Y의 몰분율은 0.5이다.\nㄴ. BC 구간에서 자유 에너지 변화(ΔG)는 0보다 크다.\nㄷ. CD 구간에서 평형 상수(K)는 3.5이다.","stemTextItemIds":["t001","t002","t003","t004","t005","t006","t007","t008","t009"],"stemAssetIds":["fig-01","fig-02","fig-03","fig-04","fig-05"],"options":[{"number":1,"text":"ㄱ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t010"]},{"number":2,"text":"ㄴ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t011"]},{"number":3,"text":"ㄱ, ㄷ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t012"]},{"number":4,"text":"ㄴ, ㄷ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t013"]},{"number":5,"text":"ㄱ, ㄴ, ㄷ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t014"]}],"answer":null,"acceptedAnswers":[],"answerStatus":"untranscribed","assets":[{"id":"fig-01","width":182,"height":33,"region":0,"bbox":[59.1,4.315,72.8,13.2],"role":"stem","overlayTextItemIds":[],"src":"/mdeet/assets/meetdeet-2010-meet-science2-08/01.webp"},{"id":"fig-02","width":250,"height":24,"region":0,"bbox":[129.5,25.115,100.0,9.6],"role":"stem","overlayTextItemIds":["t002"],"src":"/mdeet/assets/meetdeet-2010-meet-science2-08/02.webp"},{"id":"fig-03","width":297,"height":24,"region":0,"bbox":[18.3,43.515,118.8,9.6],"role":"stem","overlayTextItemIds":["t003"],"src":"/mdeet/assets/meetdeet-2010-meet-science2-08/03.webp"},{"id":"fig-04","width":554,"height":383,"region":0,"bbox":[56.3,71.115,221.6,153.2],"role":"stem","overlayTextItemIds":[],"src":"/mdeet/assets/meetdeet-2010-meet-science2-08/04.webp"},{"id":"fig-05","width":772,"height":174,"region":0,"bbox":[17.5,289.915,308.8,69.6],"role":"stem","overlayTextItemIds":["t006","t007","t008","t009"],"src"